      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even know why i'm still logging on. everything feels so pointless lately. it's like my whole life was built around one thing and now that it's gone, i'm just... a ghost. i'm just walking around taking up space and it feels so heavy. like i'm just waiting for something that's never gonna happen.",
